OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer thrown from speeding car  
OL,4,Agiven award after returning to work    
OL,6,FSmith and his wife are expecting their 
OL,7,Ffirst child, and he is working         
OL,8,Fpart-time in an office-based role at   
OL,9,FMotherwell police station.             
